{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/componentmacro"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"title":"Generating components with the component macro"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement registration, cloning, snapshots and inspection for a component from its stored properties."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional "},{"code":"FirebladeECSMacros","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" product provides the "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" macro."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It turns a "},{"code":"struct","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"enum","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" into a component and implements a set of component protocols from its stored properties, so you don’t have to write that code by hand:"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protocol"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Generated"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"stable "},{"code":"componentTypeName","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nexus.register(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nexus.registeredComponentTypes"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nexus.componentType(named:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/CloneableComponent","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"init(cloning:context:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"clone(context:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"entity.clone()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"nexus.clone(entities:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"nexus.clone(into:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"CodingKeys","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encode(to:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"nexus.encodeSnapshot(using:handling:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nexus.restoreSnapshot(from:using:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nexus.decodeSnapshot(from:using:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Nexus: Codable"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/InspectableComponent"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"componentProperties","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"generic inspection, e.g. in editors"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/DefaultInitializable"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init()"},{"type":"text","text":" if every stored property has a default value (structs)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"key path assignment, state machines"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static let componentIndex"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"typed lookups read a plain static instead of taking the registry lock"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The core "},{"code":"FirebladeECS","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" library stays dependency free. Only "},{"code":"FirebladeECSMacros","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" depends on "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swiftlang\/swift-syntax","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"All protocols can also be implemented by hand without the macro."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Adding the product","level":3,"anchor":"Adding-the-product"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the product to your target. It does not re-export "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FirebladeECS"},{"type":"text","text":": add the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FirebladeECS"},{"type":"text","text":" product too and import both modules in every file that uses "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":[".target(","    name: \"YourTargetName\",","    dependencies: [","        .product(name: \"FirebladeECS\", package: \"ecs\"),","        .product(name: \"FirebladeECSMacros\", package: \"ecs\")","    ])"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Declaring components","level":3,"anchor":"Declaring-components"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import FirebladeECS","import FirebladeECSMacros","","@Component","struct Transform {","    var position: SIMD3<Float> = .zero","    var parent: EntityIdentifier?","    @ComponentIgnored var cachedMatrix: [Float] = []  \/\/ still cloned, but not serialized or inspected","}","","@Component(excluding: .serializable)  \/\/ runtime-only component","struct RenderHandle: @unchecked Sendable {","    var handle: Int = 0","}"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The stable type name defaults to the fully qualified type name. Declare ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static let componentTypeName"},{"text":" to override it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After renaming a persisted type, list its former names in "},{"code":"static let componentTypeNameAliases","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so existing snapshots keep loading. See "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"@Component(excluding:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" takes a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ComponentMacroFeatures"},{"type":"text","text":" set: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cloneable"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".serializable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".inspectable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":".defaultInit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Registration is always implemented.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"@ComponentIgnored","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps a stored property out of serialization and inspection. Ignored properties are still cloned and need a default value."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Serialized properties need an explicit type annotation. "},{"code":"let","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" constants with an initial value are not serialized.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Members you declare yourself are not generated. Declaring any of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CodingKeys"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encode(to:)"},{"text":" leaves serialization entirely to you.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The generated initializers live in an extension, so a struct keeps its memberwise initializer. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"public"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"package","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" struct, and a struct that declares initializers, gets a generated ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init()"},{"type":"text","text":" in its body (the implicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init()"},{"text":" is internal and disappears next to declared initializers); an internal struct without initializers keeps the implicit one.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An enum is cloned as a whole and listed without properties. It is serialized only if it declares ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" itself, and it gets ","type":"text"},{"code":"DefaultInitializable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only if it declares ","type":"text"},{"code":"init()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The macro stores ","type":"text"},{"code":"static let componentIndex = registeredComponentIndex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The index still comes from the registry at first access, so it cannot collide with a lazily assigned one. Declare your own ","type":"text"},{"code":"componentIndex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to opt out.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Value types and diagnostics","level":3,"anchor":"Value-types-and-diagnostics"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"text":" reports an error when it is applied to a class: components are value types, so use a struct or enum. The nexus also asserts once per component type, in debug builds, that a hand-written conformance is not a class.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A stored property spelled ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Entity"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Entity?"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"[Entity]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Set<Entity>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"[Key: Entity]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is an error with a fix-it that replaces ","type":"text"},{"code":"Entity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityIdentifier"},{"text":". An ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Entity"},{"text":" keeps its nexus alive and is not valid after a copy, a clone or a snapshot, while an identifier is a plain value that the clone context remaps. The macro sees syntax only: an ","type":"text"},{"code":"Entity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" behind a typealias or in a nested type is not diagnosed and stays a convention.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Registering, cloning and snapshots","anchor":"Registering-cloning-and-snapshots","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let nexus = Nexus()","try nexus.register([Transform.self, RenderHandle.self])","","\/\/ Clone a whole world; entity references (`parent`) are remapped to the clones.","let playMode = Nexus()","try nexus.clone(into: playMode)","","\/\/ Export and import all serializable components, keyed by their stable type names.","var encoder = JSONEncoder()","let data = try nexus.encodeSnapshot(using: &encoder, handling: .skip)","var decoder = JSONDecoder()","try playMode.decodeSnapshot(from: data, using: &decoder)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Component types are registered automatically the first time an instance is assigned.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Register them explicitly before decoding snapshots that reference them.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" starts with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"formatVersion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and keeps the original entity identifiers."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Decoding creates new entities, remaps entity references to them through an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityReferenceResolver"},{"type":"text","text":", and rejects snapshots written in a newer format version."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Benchmarks","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"],"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials"}],"references":{"https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-syntax":{"type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"swift-syntax","type":"text"}],"title":"swift-syntax","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swiftlang\/swift-syntax","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/swiftlang\/swift-syntax"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus":{"title":"Nexus","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Nexus","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Nexus","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/SerializableComponent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A registrable component that can be encoded and decoded by its stable type name."}],"title":"SerializableComponent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SerializableComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SerializableComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/serializablecomponent","type":"topic"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/SavingAndLoadingScenes":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Store a whole "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on disk and load it again with the same entities, components and entity identifiers."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/doc